WEBVTT

00:10:28.332 --> 00:10:30.751
Life changing things happen

00:10:30.793 --> 00:10:33.629
when we look at philanthropy
beyond the money,

00:10:33.629 --> 00:10:37.591
because all the money in the world
is not going to save us.

00:10:37.966 --> 00:10:40.177
But beloved communities will.

00:10:43.514 --> 00:10:45.391
For a long time,

00:10:45.391 --> 00:10:48.143
philanthropy has been just a select few

00:10:48.852 --> 00:10:52.356
... that decide
on the impact on many

00:10:52.398 --> 00:10:54.441
who should and shouldn't get funding,

00:10:54.483 --> 00:10:57.361
what is and what is not
considered impactful.

00:10:58.487 --> 00:11:00.489
Again, in the US,